Kushakusha no yume wo
poketto ni tsumekonde

00:01:44.238 --> 00:01:51.345
Sora ni junengo no boku ni
mukete yakusoku shita

00:01:51.345 --> 00:01:56.950
Zutto shinjiteiru asu wa
machigai ja nai

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:03.290
Kitto dare yori mo tsuyoi
omoi motteiru kara

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:07.522
Sotto

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:35.355
The magazine I threw flops open

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:38.950
Showing off this year's new style

00:02:41.395 --> 00:02:44.465
If I don't live the cool way,

00:02:44.465 --> 00:02:46.133
I'll be a failure

00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:50.126
Or that's how it feels to me

00:02:52.139 --> 00:02:55.776
I try not to be swept up in it,

00:02:55.776 --> 00:02:55.909
I try not to be swept up in it,

00:02:55.909 --> 00:02:58.412
but it looks like it gets to me anyway

00:02:58.412 --> 00:03:00.039
but it looks like it gets to me anyway

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:08.055
My reflection in the mirror

00:03:08.055 --> 00:03:11.752
I see myself in it.

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:17.019
Let's see things with a naked heart

00:03:18.132 --> 00:03:22.000
I wonder what I can do

00:03:23.504 --> 00:03:28.876
Wrapped up in a white blanket

00:03:28.876 --> 00:03:33.647
Now, let's dream together

00:03:33.647 --> 00:03:39.653
Kiss away yesterday's pain

00:03:39.653 --> 00:03:42.723
The things we're looking for

00:03:42.723 --> 00:03:46.460
are like the clouds we cannot touch

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:49.623
We want to touch them and feel them

00:03:50.864 --> 00:03:52.566
Come on, darling,

00:03:52.566 --> 00:03:56.866
take my outstretched hand

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:21.528
I hope you understand my feelings,

00:04:21.528 --> 00:04:27.125
but I can't put them in words

00:04:29.236 --> 00:04:35.075
These feelings I conceal in small talk

